  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Madison Willow bag adapts easily to travel days, dinner reservations or any occasion that calls for a compact crossbody that holds essentials. You get effortless organization with a flap closure, secure zip pockets inside and out, and an adjustable strap for styling options. The gold-tone zipper pulls add polish to its slim profile, and durable material keeps the finish looking crisp, season after season.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Saffiano PVC</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Two way script logo lining</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap Drop: 22&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Flap Closure With Magnetic Snap</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 9.8&quot; (L) x 6.2&quot; (H) x 2.20&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
